      openingQuestionProvenance: "ratified",
      reality: `The physical design of North American communities; sprawling suburbs, privatized public land, car-centric infrastructure; has physically dismantled the local commons. This overlaps with Hope's Domain 7 and Freedom's Domain 3; Unity's distinct concern is the loss of the specific cross-demographic, organic collisions that build collective (not just personal) solidarity.`,
      impactPoint: `Zoning and design that restores non-commercial, cross-demographic gathering space as default civic infrastructure, not an amenity.`,
